WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:08.650
<v Audio Description>Visual scene one: Card one glows amber as a bulky, standalone two-hundred-dollar amber hardware box fades into a sleek cyan phone icon.

2
00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:15.522
<v Presenter>First, people once paid hundreds of dollars for standalone spell check, yet today it comes free everywhere.

3
00:00:15.862 --> 00:00:24.524
<v Audio Description>Visual scene two: Card two highlights in cyan while a tiny emerald lookup pulse checks words locally at near-zero power inside a writing window.

4
00:00:24.864 --> 00:00:30.923
<v Presenter>Second, it became free because checking a word costs almost nothing to run inside tools you already use.

5
00:00:31.263 --> 00:00:39.280
<v Audio Description>Visual scene three: Card three shines emerald as a rotating 3D globe lights up nodes for more than seven billion local device owners.

6
00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:46.925
<v Presenter>Third, new computer intelligence reaches seven billion people only when it runs cheaply on devices people already own.
